'''Lazy Miner''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Gold Mine}}. They task the player with finding their lost {{Item|Iron Pickaxe}} as part of the {{Quest|Lost and Found}} quest.

== Quest ==
Interacting with the '''Lazy Miner''' for the first time starts the {{Quest|Lost and Found}} quest. They claim they lost their {{Item|Iron Pickaxe}} in the mines. The pickaxe can be found at {{Coordinates|-18|24|-305}}. Once the player finds the {{Item|Iron Pickaxe}}, they get to keep it.

